// ============================================================================
//  BLOX FRUITS TRADE WATCHER — YOUR SETTINGS (this is the ONLY file to edit)
// ============================================================================
//
//  HOW TO EDIT (on your phone or PC, takes 30 seconds):
//    1. On github.com open this file and tap the pencil icon (Edit).
//    2. Change what you want below. Lines starting with // are ignored.
//    3. Tap "Commit changes". Done — the next scan (within ~10 min) uses it.
//
//  WHAT EACH SETTING DOES:
//    send_alerts_to        Your email. Alerts + digests go here.
//    i_own                 Your fruits: "Name": how many. This is what the
//                          scanner can offer in trades. Spelling must match
//                          the game, e.g. "Tiger", "Kitsune", "Dragon",
//                          "Buddha", "Permanent Portal".
//    hunted_fruits         Fruits you WANT. The instant you can get one in a
//                          fair-or-better trade, you get an email. ("Tiger"
//                          also matches "Permanent Tiger" automatically.)
//    min_profit_millions   Ignore trades with less profit than this
//                          (in millions). 0 = show any fair-or-better trade.
//    max_of_each_fruit_to_give   Never give more than N copies of the same
//                          fruit in one trade.
//    skip_community_voted_lose   true = skip trades the community voted "L".
//    scan_every_minutes    How often to scan. (On GitHub cloud it's ~10 min
//                          no matter what — that's GitHub's schedule.)
//    digest_every_minutes  How often you get the "everything else" summary
//                          email of new matching trades.
//    max_trades_per_email  Cap so emails don't get huge.
//
//  ALERTS — custom email rules. Each alert = one block in the list.
//  Delete any line you don't need inside an alert; only "name" is required.
//    name                    Any label. Shows in the email subject.
//    email_every_minutes     0 = email INSTANTLY when a trade matches.
//                            60 = collect matches, email at most once/hour.
//    trade_gives             Alert only if the trade GIVES you one of these.
//    trade_wants             Alert only if the trade ASKS FOR one of these
//                            (useful: "someone wants my Buddha").
//    min_profit_millions     Only trades with at least this much profit.
//    min_profit_percent      Only trades with at least this % profit (10 = +10%).
//    min_value_received_millions   Only trades giving you at least this value.
//    max_value_given_millions      Only trades costing you at most this value.
//    only_win_trades         true = only community-calculator "W" trades.
//    min_confidence          0-100. How sure the price data is. 70 = solid.
//    min_demand              0-10. How wanted the fruits are.
//    enabled                 false = pause this alert without deleting it.
//
// ============================================================================
{
  "send_alerts_to": "topical_codices_0g@icloud.com",

  "i_own": {
